            "block_content": "The parties hereto agree that should any Article, part or paragraph of this Agreement be declared by a Federal or State Court of competent and final jurisdiction in the premises to be unlawful, invalid, ineffective or unenforceable, said Article, part or paragraph shall not affect the validity and enforceability of any other Article, part or paragraph hereof, and the remainder of this Agreement shall continue in full force and effect.",
