            "block_content": "Section 1. This Agreement shall be effective from November 10, 1962 to May 8, 1965, and shall continue from year to year after May 8, 1965 unless either Party serves notice in writing on or before sixty (60) days prior to the expiration date, of a desire either for changes in, or termination of, the Agreement.",
